// Title: PowerShell Script Change Permission Via Set-Acl
// ID: bdeb2cff-af74-4094-8426-724dc937f20a
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-10-18
// Tags: attack.stealth
// Description: Detects PowerShell execution to set the ACL of a file or a folder
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where (((process.command_line like "*_Set-Acl *" and process.command_line like "*_-AclObject *" and process.command_line like "*_-Path *")) and (((process.pe.original_file_name == "PowerShell.EXE" or process.pe.original_file_name == "pwsh.dll")) or ((process.executable endswith "\\powershell.exe" or process.executable endswith "\\pwsh.exe"))))
